flowchart TD
    A[Authenticated B站 @ notice] --> B[Normalize UID, rpid, time, BV/AID]
    B --> C{Official video locator and comment ID?}
    C -- No --> D[Diagnostic: source location missing, no send]
    C -- Yes --> E{Within 24h, enabled and authorized?}
