    E -- Yes --> G{Meaningful notification body?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Existing verified context and reply pipeline]
    G -- No --> I[Read original comment via official B站 MCP]
    I --> J{Exact BV + rpid + sender UID verified?}
    J -- No --> K[Reject author mismatch or bounded retry for read errors]
    J -- Yes --> L[Preserve comment text with safe mention parsing]
    L --> H
    H --> M[Video metadata, subtitles, comments under read budget]
    M --> N[One fish persona + social willingness + model decision]
    N --> O[Permission, quota, dedupe and confirmed send receipt]
